@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@token = paste-access-token-here
# Get a token from AUTH-02 (POST /auth/login) and paste it into @token.
# Seeded logins: admin@brightloop.test / Admin@12345, staff@brightloop.test / Staff@12345, customer@brightloop.test / Customer@12345
# M8 Hardening & Performance Verification: Run `php artisan db:seed --class=DemoVolumeSeeder` prior to testing with high volume (3k subs, 8k invoices).

### M8-01 Performance: List subscriptions with eager loading (< 2s on 3,000+ records)
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions?page=1&per_page=15&sort=created_at&direction=desc
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### M8-02 Performance: List invoices with customer & subscription eager loaded (< 2s on 8,000+ records)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?page=1&per_page=15&sort=invoice_date&direction=desc
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### M8-03 Performance: Filter overdue invoices with composite index scan
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?page=1&per_page=15&overdue=true
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### M8-04 Hardening: Billing run execution against volume subscriptions
POST {{baseUrl}}/billing/run
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "as_of_date": "2026-03-01"
}
